{"id":"1159c02b461c2377","group":"58","path":"58/batch04/58-df-zfc-forcing-totally-proper-poset.md","title":"ZFC Forcing Totally Proper Poset","display":"df-zfc-forcing-totally-proper-poset — ZFC Forcing Totally Proper Poset","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-forcing-totally-proper-poset","aliases":["58-df-zfc-forcing-totally-proper-poset"],"display":"df-zfc-forcing-totally-proper-poset — ZFC Forcing Totally Proper Poset","depends_on":["[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-forcing-totally-proper-poset"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-forcing-totally-proper-poset</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-forcing-totally-proper-poset — ZFC Forcing Totally Proper Poset"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8935dcac821c0104\" href=\"?note=8935dcac821c0104\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-proper.md\">../batch06/58-df-proper.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b5833df5ef175153\" href=\"?note=b5833df5ef175153\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md\">../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P,R,1_P,\\mathcal L,F\\in V\">\\(P,R,1_P,\\mathcal L,F\\in V\\)</span> (forcing carrier, order, greatest condition, structure language, and forcing-relation code)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicates from dependencies)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotallyProperStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{TotallyProperStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingTotallyProperPoset}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcForcingTotallyProperPoset}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (explicit predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}totally\\text{-}proper\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{TotallyProperStructure}_S(P,R,1_P,\\mathcal L,F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,R,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,R,\\mathcal L)\\land F\\subseteq P\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\langle1_P,\\ulcorner(\\omega^\\omega)^{V[\\dot G]}=(\\omega^\\omega)^V\\urcorner\\rangle\\in F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}totally\\text{-}proper\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{TotallyProperStructure}_S(P,R,1_P,\\mathcal L,F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,R,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,R,\\mathcal L)\\land F\\subseteq P\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\langle1_P,\\ulcorner(\\omega^\\omega)^{V[\\dot G]}=(\\omega^\\omega)^V\\urcorner\\rangle\\in F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}totally\\text{-}proper\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingTotallyProperPoset}_S(P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,1_P,\\mathcal L,F\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TotallyProperStructure}_S(P,R,1_P,\\mathcal L,F)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}totally\\text{-}proper\\text{-}poset} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcForcingTotallyProperPoset}_S(P)\\leftrightarrow\\exists R,1_P,\\mathcal L,F\\in V\\;\\mathrm{TotallyProperStructure}_S(P,R,1_P,\\mathcal L,F)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Total properness is properness together with a coded forcing assertion that no new reals are added; all forcing data are explicitly bound.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch06/58-df-proper.md","status":"resolved","id":"8935dcac821c0104","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-proper.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"b5833df5ef175153","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch15/58-df-zfc-forcing2-forcing-poset.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"P,R,1_P,\\mathcal L,F\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TotallyProperStructure}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcForcingTotallyProperPoset}_S\\subseteq V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{-}totally\\text{-}proper\\text{-}structure} \\vdash \\mathrm{TotallyProperStructure}_S(P,R,1_P,\\mathcal L,F)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{ZfcForcing2ForcingPoset}_S(P,R,1_P)\\land\\mathrm{ProperForcing}_S(P,R,\\mathcal L)\\land F\\subseteq P\\times\\mathrm{Fml}_S\\land\\langle1_P,\\ulcorner(\\omega^\\omega)^{V[\\dot G]}=(\\omega^\\omega)^V\\urcorner\\rangle\\in F","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}forcing\\text{